---
description:
  Verifies that combining a classDef with a direct style override correctly sets
  a node's fill, stroke, and text color, under the hand-drawn look.
config:
  look: handDrawn
  fontFamily: courier
  logLevel: 0
---
graph LR
  foo-->bar

  classDef foo fill:lightblue,color:green,stroke:#FF9E2C,font-weight:bold
  style foo fill:#F99,stroke-width:2px,stroke:#F0F
  style bar fill:#999,color: #00ff00, stroke-width:10px,stroke:#0F0
